rimental and control group by Student&#x02019;s t-test at 0.05. C: control group and T: administration of <italic>Carthamus tinctorius</italic> was started at age of 3 weeks old.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="ijms-10-00292f3"/></fig><fig id="f4-ijms-10-00292" position="float"><label>Figure 4.</label><caption><p>Flow chart showing the methanolic extraction from safflower seeds.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="ijms-10-00292f4"/></fig><table-wrap id="t1-ijms-10-00292" position="float"><label>Table 1.</label><caption><p>Mineral contents of extracts from <italic>Carthamus tinctorius.</italic></p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th align="center" rowspan="2" colspan="1">Elements</th><th align="center" colspan="2" rowspan="1">Contents (&#x003bc;g/g)<hr/></th></tr><tr><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">W<sup>1)</sup></th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">M<sup>2)</sup></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Al</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.175</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.019</td></tr><tr><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Ca</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.075</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">3.752</td></tr><tr><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Cu</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.055</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.015</td></tr><tr><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Fe</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.100</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.170</td></tr><tr><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">K</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2.306</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.313</td></tr><tr><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Mg</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.474</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.023</td></tr><tr><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Na</td><td align=